Journey: Every Larkspur application is up
Id: platform-health
Tags: @smoke @api
Risk: 5
Requirements: OPS-1

Call API "GET ${API_URL}/v1/health" and store as health
Expect the health response status is 200
Expect response health "$.status" equals "UP"
Call API "GET ${PORTAL_URL}/health" and store as portal
Expect response portal "$.status" equals "UP"
Call API "GET ${BACKOFFICE_URL}/health" and store as backoffice
Expect response backoffice "$.app" equals "backoffice"
Run query "SELECT COUNT(*) AS n FROM policies" on claims as policyCount
Expect ${policyCount.0.n} > 200
